						"eyebrow": "How it works",
						"heading": "Your repository is the CMS",
						"description": "Developers build the components. Editors compose them visually. Conloca stores the result as files in your Git repository, and Astro renders those same files into your website. No content database. No hosted CMS API between your site and its content.",
